# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated dashboard extracts
#
# src/dashboards/build_excel_dashboard.py regenerates these from the mart layer.
# The two large extracts are NOT committed: their rows are already embedded
# inside NBCI_Cost_Dashboard.xlsx, so committing them would store the same data
# twice. extract_manifest.csv IS committed - it is the provenance record
# (source object, row counts, generation timestamp).
#
# The QA script's working backup of the WPS-authored build is never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/dashboards/extracts/ext_state_cost_panel.csv
outputs/dashboards/extracts/ext_metric_medians.csv
outputs/dashboards/*.bak.xlsx
